# Zone art: originals and mockup PNGs stay out of git (large; the owner keeps the originals).
# Only the converted game files (Azerfolio/Media/Zones/*.blp) are committed.
art/source/*
!art/source/.gitkeep
mockups/zone-art/*.png
art/review/

# Never commit SavedVariables dumps (they can contain chat and friend-list data).
*.lua.bak
WTF/
mockups/banner-art/*.png
